  "body": "Corresponds to #5235 \n\nThis pull request adds the step to check if `type` and `credentials` values are same with these of matched SharedWorkerGlobalScope before connecting to it.\n\nIf there exists SharedWorkerGlobalScope with same `name`, `url` and `origin`, the existing shared worker is set to `worker global scope`. This is not changed by this PR.\nTraditionally, we connect to matched shared worker regardless of `type` and `credentials` values. However, this causes a constructed shared worker to connect a shared worker with different type or credentials which are specified.\nThis PR adds the step to check if `type` and `credentials` values match an existing shared worker. If not, the step fires an error event and stops connecting to the existing shared worker.\n\nThe related bug is filed in Chromium: https://crbug.com/1048966\n\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * Chrome: We're interested in this and implementation is already done. [CL](https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/2041386)\n   * Firefox: Sounds interested in this issue (https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/5258#issuecomment-583473599)\n- [ ] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * [web-platform-tests/wpt/#21651](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/21651)\n- [ ] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/master/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Chrome: https://crbug.com/1050438\n   * Firefox: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1614242\n   * Safari: SharedWorker is not supported\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5258/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 10, 2020, 4:56 PM UTC (7ba504e)\">/acknowledgements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5258/d22075c...7ba504e/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 10, 2020, 4:56 PM UTC (7ba504e)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5258/parsing.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 10, 2020, 4:56 PM UTC (7ba504e)\">/parsing.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5258/d22075c...7ba504e/parsing.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 10, 2020, 4:56 PM UTC (7ba504e)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5258/workers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 10, 2020, 4:56 PM UTC (7ba504e)\">/workers.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5258/d22075c...7ba504e/workers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 10, 2020, 4:56 PM UTC (7ba504e)\">diff</a> )",
